WEBVTT

00:00:58.796 --> 00:01:00.876
She’s watching her father at work.

00:01:01.236 --> 00:01:03.876
The wooden skeleton of the great loom,

00:01:03.876 --> 00:01:06.916
the finished tapestries
hanging on the wall.

00:01:07.236 --> 00:01:09.276
Clackety-clack goes the loom.

00:01:09.316 --> 00:01:10.516
The river floods,

00:01:10.516 --> 00:01:12.636
sweeping her parents away.

00:01:14.556 --> 00:01:16.476
The loom comes apart:

00:01:16.476 --> 00:01:18.596
colored threads in the water.

00:01:19.236 --> 00:01:23.276
The sound of hammer striking stone.

00:01:23.276 --> 00:01:25.116
The choking dust.

00:01:25.116 --> 00:01:26.996
The quarry at night.

00:01:27.316 --> 00:01:29.636
Young people around the fire.